CONTEXT:
[1] Individuals with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) may experience difficulties with verbal and nonverbal communication, social interactions, and understanding nuances of language.

[2] Many ASD patients experience co-occurring conditions such as anxiety, ADHD, epilepsy, sleep disorders, or gastrointestinal issues.

